    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Coole Lodge, 9 Barnstead Drive, presents a rare opportunity to purchase a 4 bedroom detached property with a   substantial private garden to the rear. It is located in a highly sought after, mature and private cul-de-sac, just off the Blackrock Road. \r\nThe Barnstead Drive Estate was constructed in the 1960s by O’Connor Builders and designed by architect Denis Higgins. The property has been extended to the front with a large front facing sitting room filled with natural light. \r\nThis home benefits from its’ extensive site size with a large, open graveled driveway providing space for up to 4    vehicles. The driveway is wonderfully bordered by mature hedging on both sides with two large stone pillars framing the entrance onto the property’s grounds.\r\nOne of the standout features of this fantastic property is the expansive, South East facing back garden which extends to approx. 0.25 of an acre. The back garden also encloses an outdoor swimming pool.\r\nThe interior of the property is tastefully decorated with warm wood tones from the hardwood kitchen and flooring, with a neutral colour scheme sweeping through the residence.\r\nThe overall setting offers privacy matched with an abundance of space and tranquility neatly placed in the heart of Blackrock."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance \t\t \r\nThe front door opens onto a well lit L-shaped lobby, benefiting from recessed lighting, large double glazed windows and natural timber floors. There is a cloakroom and bathroom just off  the foyer entrance. Recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBathroom \t \t\t\t\r\nPartially tiled accessibility bathroom with 3-piece suite and Marble tiled floors. Recessed lighting. \r\n\r\n\r\nFamily Room \t \t\t\t\r\nA bright and elegant family room recently added on as part of an extension. The room is well lit by a  combination of PVC double French doors, and PVC double glazed windows. The rooms white walls are compliment by the warm hues of the timber floor and doors. Recessed lighting. \r\n\r\nUtility/Laundry Room \t\t\t\r\nTiled floor, eye and floor level cabinets, plumbed  and wired for washer and dryer, with extensive storage. Recessed lighting. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining \r\nBright and beautifully presented dual L-shaped   kitchen with quality slate countertop, tiled floor.  \r\nThe kitchen natural flows into a well lit dining space with natural timber floor, where diners benefit from a patio door opening onto the property’s extensive rear garden. Recessed lighting with underfloor heating.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nConnected to the dining room, the main living room  centers around a modern wood burning stove and gets natural light from a large scenic window,  providing an excellent view of the whole garden.   Recessed lighting. \r\n\r\nSitting Room \r\nBright and cosy room, accessible via the lobby, natural timber floor, double French doors  to rear garden. Recessed lighting \r\n\r\nMain Bedroom \t      \r\nThis bright and spacious principal bedroom, with carpet floor, floor to ceiling wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEnsuite \r\nWC, wash hand basin, shower, tiled walls, and anti-slip flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \t         \r\nLarge double glazed window, carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nEnsuite \r\nWC, and wash hand basin. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBathroom \r\nFully tiled bathroom, with 3 piece suite, anti-slip floors and electric shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nBright and airy room  with carpet floor and PVC double glazed window.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 \r\nBright and airy room with carpet floor and PVC double glazed window.\r\n\r\nEnsuite \r\nWC, wash hand basin, shower\r\n. \r\nAttic\r\nFloored attic with recessed storage. Accessed via pull down attic ladder."
      },
